cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research brief or analysis code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Cloud-9 Assembly Research: 3I/ATLAS Interstellar Comet Analysis"
abstract: >
  Integrated analysis of JWST MIRI volatile detections (methane, CO2, CO) on 
  interstellar comet 3I/ATLAS, and the ISO contribution to galactic dark matter 
  density (Horns et al. 2026). Includes reproducible Jupyter notebooks, 
  governance sandbox state machines, and artificiality assessment updates 
  within the Cloud-9 Assembly Index framework.
